OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill be mostly dry with some clear
OL,7,Fspells. Cloud will spread east from
OL,8,Fafter midnight but some clearer spells
OL,9,Fremain in the east.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FBright spells and mostly dry
OL,12,Fin the morning. Cloud and rain,
OL,13,Fturning occasionally heavy, spreads
OL,14,Feast from the early afternoon.
